        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file `query_error_logs.py` that queries recent error log entries filtered by severity and time range using a concrete external provider, I will use the AWS CloudWatch service. This service allows querying log groups and filtering logs based on various criteria, including severity and time range. I will use the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with CloudWatch. The code will include the import of `boto3` and the use of CloudWatch-specific client methods, making the provider identifiable. </thinking>\n",
