    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To write application log events that include a shared request or correlation identifier, I will use the Amazon CloudWatch service. This service is a monitoring and observability service provided by AWS that allows users to collect and track metrics, collect and monitor log files, set alarms, and automatically react to changes in their AWS resources. The integration will be identifiable by the use of the `boto3` library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) Software Development Kit (SDK) for Python, specifically for interacting with CloudWatch. </thinking>\n",
